  "note": "SST, chlorophyll (NOAA-20 near-real-time) and ETOPO bathymetry verified with check_sources. The gap-filled chlorophyll entry is verified but switched off (its filled cells are estimates). gradient_min values are placeholders to calibrate against real grids.",
